                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Noise"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We subject ourselves to an 'acoustic startle response' each morning if we're aroused by the unpleasant sound of an an alarm clock. Loud or startling noise can, in the long run, induce cardiovascular and digestive distress. Noise has been shown to cause irritability and aggression."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
